#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Run the terminology-lookup Tool down the four reuse-first rungs of the terminology-coding methodology: (1) target guide vocabulary, (2) smart-base generic personas, GRADE code lists and guideline-domain glossary, (3) external WHO-FIC/ILO standards (ICD-11, ICHI/CDHIv2, ISCO-08, ATC), (4) local glossary candidate (status: candidate, source: extracted), or could-not-determine for business-process with its WARNING line."
msgstr ""

